<title>SWEDEN: TABLE-ICELAND AIRPORT JULY CARGO VOLUMES UP 14 PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE-ICELAND AIRPORT JULY CARGO VOLUMES UP 14 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iceland's international airport at Keflavik handled 1,785 tonnes of freight in July, a 14 percent rise over the same month a year earlier, Iceland's civil aviation administration said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The administration published the following figures about airport activity for the month.</p>
<p>						   July 1997     July 1996</p>
<p>KEFLAVIK INT'L AIRPORT</p>
<p> Cargo export (in tonnes)			1,084	     883</p>
<p>	 import					  701	     683</p>
<p> Total						 1,785	   1,566</p>
<p> Mail export (in tonnes)			    35		34</p>
<p>	import					   112	     107</p>
<p> Total						   147	     141</p>
<p> Passengers					150,787	 150,083</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
</text>
